Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 02:18:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Optimize entity distance hot path

Leaf-inspired stateless micro-optimization. Avoid the Entity -> Vec3 overload
hop for the extremely common entity distance calculation and keep the squared
math directly inlineable by the JIT. No shared cache or mutable cross-region
state is introduced.


diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/entity/Entity.java b/net/minecraft/world/entity/Entity.java
--- a/net/minecraft/world/entity/Entity.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/world/entity/Entity.java
@@ -2465,7 +2465,10 @@ public abstract class Entity
     }
 
     public double distanceToSqr(final Entity entity) {
-        return this.distanceToSqr(entity.position());
+        final double xd = this.getX() - entity.getX();
+        final double yd = this.getY() - entity.getY();
+        final double zd = this.getZ() - entity.getZ();
+        return xd * xd + yd * yd + zd * zd;
     }
 
     public double distanceToSqr(final Vec3 pos) {
